  data: {
    LLM: "If you hold many trumps but lack the Ace, call your own Ace's suit to ensure your partner has a powerful entry card.\n\nLast Trick Management: Save your highest trump (usually the Ace) for the final trick, as capturing it is worth the same value as an entire Ace or Ten.\n\nDefensive Marriage Spoiling: If you suspect an opponent has a Marriage, lead that suit early to force them to play one of the marriage cards defensively before they can declare it.",
    Player: "If you hold many trumps but lack the Ace, call your own Ace's suit to ensure your partner has a powerful entry card.\n\nLast Trick Management: Save your highest trump (usually the Ace) for the final trick, as capturing it is worth the same value as an entire Ace or Ten.\n\nDefensive Marriage Spoiling: If you suspect an opponent has a Marriage, lead that suit early to force them to play one of the marriage cards defensively before they can declare it.",
